        "Notes": "Letter XIII (to Benedetto Varchi - 1538) mentions `Ombroso il qual e` un sanese dell`Accademia de gl` Intronati`. Criitcal edition by Mario Menghini, intro. Aulo Greco (Florence 1957). According to Greco`s critical edition of Caro`s letters (Florence, 1959), vol. 3, p. 313, letter 545 is addressed to Bocchi`s Academy. \nLetters from 1538 and 1540 are in relation to the Accademia della Virtu`",
